OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEast will
OL,6,Fremain cloudy with further patchy
OL,7,Flight rain. West dry with clear
OL,8,Fspells. Risk of frost and the fog
OL,9,Fpatches, chiefly to rural parts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FSettled, largely dry fare
OL,12,Fwith bright and sunny spells
OL,13,Fincreasing, but early mist and fog may
OL,14,Fbe slow to burn back. Winds light.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FPatchy light rain possible in Lothian
OL,18,Fand Borders, while Dumfries and
OL,19,FGalloway stays dry and occasionally
OL,20,Fbright. Moderate easterly breezes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
